{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/rejectionreports"]}],"metadata":{"title":"rejectionReports","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L214","fileName":"Tracker.swift"},"externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV16rejectionReportsScSyAA15RejectionReportVGvp","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rejectionReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncStream","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"RejectionReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on it, in the order the rejections happen."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rejectionReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"RejectionReport","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/RejectionReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker’s worker checks each event’s "},{"code":"constraintViolation()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" before anything else, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rejected event is never enriched, held by a consent, written to a store or delivered. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"record a store recovered is checked too, and one rejected is forgotten by the store. In"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"debug builds each rejection is also logged at error level."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a rejection joins the waiting report of the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event, property and keyword, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reports waiting unread are at most one per constraint the app declares, however many events"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"break them. Copies of a tracker share one sequence, which has one consumer and ends once the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker has finished. A "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" tracker’s is empty."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/noOp":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/noop","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A tracker that drops every event, logging each one at debug level. Its ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"empty.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"noOp","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","text":"Tracker","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","title":"noOp"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/records-swift.property":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/records-swift.property","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The records of the events this tracker tracks, for a delivery to read."}],"title":"records","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"records","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tracker","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Records","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV7RecordsV"}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/rejectionReports":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/rejectionreports","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on it, in the order the rejections happen."}],"title":"rejectionReports","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rejectionReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncStream","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"RejectionReport","kind":"typeIdentifie